    "source_semantic_class": "normative_medication_recommendation",
    "title_or_context": "e high value of beta-blocker therapy among HF patients. A model-based analysis, using generic beta-blocker costs, found beta-blocker therapy was high value.<sup>4</sup> These results were consistent with earlier model-based cost-effectiveness analyses<sup>5-7</sup> and a trial-based economic analysis of the US Carvedilol Heart Failure (CHF) Trials Program.<sup>8</sup> Each of these studies also found treatment with a beta blocker was high value despite using previously higher beta-blocker costs."
  },
